### Linux: Guix Shell Execution

Source: https://github.com/tauri-apps/wry/blob/dev/README.md

Command to enter a Guix shell environment based on the provided manifest, ensuring all specified dependencies are available.

```bash
guix shell -m manifest.scm
```
